"To design the tile, print a JSON object instead: `{\"text\": \"Deploy\", \"detail\": \"2 min ago\", \"symbol\": \"cloud.fill\", \"color\": \"#2EC27E\", \"progress\": 0.6, \"status\": \"ok\", \"url\": \"https://…\"}`. Every field is optional." = "Para diseñar el widget, imprime un objeto JSON: `{\"text\": \"Deploy\", \"detail\": \"2 min ago\", \"symbol\": \"cloud.fill\", \"color\": \"#2EC27E\", \"progress\": 0.6, \"status\": \"ok\", \"url\": \"https://…\"}`. Todos los campos son opcionales.";
